        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Company shall in no case be obligated to continue payments under this provision with respect to jury service (a) more frequently than once in any twelve (12) month period; (b) for jury service exceeding fifteen (15) working days while on call; (c) for jury service performed while on Leave of Absence, Sick Leave or Vacation. The Company will not limit payments to a specific number of days for grand jury service.",
            "block_bbox": [
                100,
                154,
